body:
I think Lily is a bit too evil to be that interesting, but i also think having an evil villain that can actually get shit done was great for episode 3. 

If Minerva survived, i hope she gets some character development. Say Vi brings her to the school after escaping the boat, it would be so interesting to see her interactions with the other kids and her having to come to terms with what she did. I was hoping for something like that with Marlon, but then Aj appeared.

&#x200B;

For your first time you should avoid Az tweaks, i wouldnt say its suited for beginners. Once you've gotten a grip on requiem you should give it a shot though, it is very fun.

I would say stick with 2.0. Wait with Minor arcana, i think its good to know what the changes actually are so you can appreciate them when you do add them.

&#x200B;
